    "No direct experimental CNS exposure measurement for the exact query molecule.",
    "No P-gp/BCRP efflux or unbound brain-to-plasma ratio data for the query.",
    "Quantitative Kp,uu,uu,brain values are not available, but positive in vivo CNS exposure across multiple high-transfer analogues supports meaningful access."
  ],
